; Two take patterns need two distinct occurrences: a firing's taken
; occurrences are pairwise distinct (Core.lean, Firing.Shapes). Two copies of
; (tok) fire the rule once. bag_rules_take_two_copies_set runs it under the set
; store, where the copies are one row and nothing fires. A conjunctive match in
; HE or PeTTa succeeds on one copy.
(step one)
(tok)
(tok)
(rule pair (take (tok) (tok)) (make (pair)))
